<section class="band">
  <div class="band__inner">
    <p class="statement">Insight is a start. <em>Practice is what changes the loop.</em></p>
    <p class="soft">Most of us already know what we’d like to do differently. A Practice Lab gives you the room to actually try it: with real people, honest feedback and enough repetition that the new way starts to feel like yours.</p>
  </div>
</section>

