    <section class="section" id="how-it-works">
      <p class="label">How it works</p>
      <h2>The flow of <em>a lab</em></h2>
      <hr class="rule">
      <p class="soft">Every lab, from a two-hour evening to a multi-day immersion, moves through the same three steps. You come as the scientist of your own life. We bring the instruments.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><span class="steps__num">01</span><h3>See</h3><p>We settle in and set clear agreements. Then a short teaching names one loop, where it comes from and what the research says about it. Every exercise has an opt-out, and what’s shared stays in the room.</p></li>
        <li><span class="steps__num">02</span><h3>Shift</h3><p>Guided exercises, with a partner or a small group, let you test a new move. You notice what happens in your body and in the other person, and get honest feedback.</p></li>
        <li><span class="steps__num">03</span><h3>Prove</h3><p>You leave with one practice to keep testing in your life, so the change holds after the room is gone.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

